        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions WST150072SMTSS4, 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Modern Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis custom 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Stainless Wasatch Pull is 72\" overall with 25\" centers. Top mounting hole is located 35\" on center from top of pull and bottom mounting hole is 12\" on center from bottom of pull.  This modern stainless steel pull is custom made to order and is not returnable.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Wasatch Stainless Steel Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter:  1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length:  72\" Overall</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center:  25\"</li>\r\n<li>Top Mounting Hole: 35\" on center to top of pull</li>\r\n<li>Bottom Mounting Hole: 12\" on center to bottom of pull</li>\r\n<li>Finish:  Satin Stainless Steel</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the pull, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
